WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.050
Every search starts with your mandate.

2
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.000
On your kickoff call,

3
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.450
we're going to go deep into your buy box:

4
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.050
the size of the business you can buy,

5
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:07.900
the geographies, the vertical,

6
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.000
the EBITDA range,

7
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.100
and the deal breakers that are going to make you walk away.

8
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.950
You're also going to meet your account manager,

9
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:15.000
who's going to own your search from day one.

10
00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:17.050
Then we build your list,

11
00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.900
not an export from a database.

12
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.500
The big databases only show about 40% of the market.

13
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.100
So we're going to pull from multiple sources

14
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.400
and make sure every owner

15
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.550
that could fit is on our contact list.

16
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.950
Then we're going to enrich each email record:

17
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.300
the owner's name, phone, address,

18
00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:34.700
and verify it all before anyone reaches out.

19
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.400
At the same time, we're going to buy

20
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.400
and warm up the email infrastructure your campaign sends from,

21
00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:41.950
and we write all your messaging and collateral

22
00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:44.950
around what makes you the right buyer for that owner.

23
00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:46.600
By day 21,

24
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.100
your deal team is built

25
00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:49.850
and trained on your buy box and live.

26
00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.900
You only ever look at businesses that actually fit.
